OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I was too young to have
OL,4,Acancer - it had spread by the time I
OL,5,Awas diagnosed
OL,6,
OL,7,FPractice 1 Keir Hardie Health Park said
OL,8,Fit could not discuss individual cases
OL,9,Fbut encouraged patients to "make a
OL,10,Fsecond appointment" if they had
OL,11,Fconcerns about their health or care.
